<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The cares of life come thronging fast,</l><l>Upon my soul their shadows cast;</l><l>Their gloom reminds my heart at last</l><l>Thou thinkest, Lord, of me!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let shadows come, let shadows go,</l><l>Let life be bright, or dark with woe,</l><l>I am content, for this I know</l><l>Thou thinkest, Lord, of me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
